{"seq":5,"slug":"retention-churn-support","title":"留存、流失与客户支持","stage":"DONE","category":"indie-app-shipping","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/retention-churn-support","rating":{"composite":3.78,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 留存、流失与客户支持 简介\n\n留住用户比获取用户更根本——留不住的产品像漏水桶，再多获客也存不住。本 hub 面向想让 app 可持续增长的独立开发者，从引导与激活（啊哈时刻与价值时间、onboarding 设计、激活指标）讲起，覆盖留存机制（留存为何是根本、习惯回路与参与、留存曲线）、流失诊断（群组分析、用户为什么离开、流失调查与信号），以及客服即留存（单人团队支持、AI 优先客服、支持即留存）。它聚焦留存/参与/客服，与「订阅、定价与计费」hub 的流失感知定价互补。贯穿全篇的实操主线是：先补桶再加水（留存优先）、尽快让用户体验核心价值、用数据诊断流失对症下药、把支持从成本变成留存引擎——并守住「健康参与而非成瘾操纵」的底线。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"onboarding-activation","title":"Onboarding Activation","docCount":3,"url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/retention-churn-support/onboarding-activation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"aha-moment-and-ttv","title":"啊哈时刻与价值时间","url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/retention-churn-support/onboarding-activation/aha-moment-and-ttv"},{"seq":2,"slug":"onboarding-design","title":"引导流程设计","url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/retention-churn-support/onboarding-activation/onboarding-design"},{"seq":3,"slug":"activation-metrics","title":"激活指标","url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/retention-churn-support/onboarding-activation/activation-metrics"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"retention-mechanics","title":"Retention Mechanics","docCount":3,"url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/retention-churn-support/retention-mechanics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"why-retention-matters","title":"留存为何是根本","url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/retention-churn-support/retention-mechanics/why-retention-matters"},{"seq":2,"slug":"habit-loops-and-engagement","title":"习惯回路与参与","url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/retention-churn-support/retention-mechanics/habit-loops-and-engagement"},{"seq":3,"slug":"retention-curves","title":"留存曲线","url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/retention-churn-support/retention-mechanics/retention-